%% Title: Provider Registry Loading To Data Source Creation
%% @version 1.1.0
%% @date    2026-10-09
%% Reviewed against main 9a7339dc: composition/providers/provider_registry.py and _creation.py
%% @type    sequenceDiagram
%% @level   System / Interaction
%% @nodes   6
%% RULES: RULES.md §2.2, §2.7, ADR-005, ADR-025
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as CLI / composition entrypoint
    participant Registry as ProviderRegistry
    participant Store as provider store
    participant Config as provider config
    participant Creator as ProviderCreator
    participant DS as registered data_source_creator

    CLI->>Registry: ensure_loaded()
    Registry->>Store: load default registrations
    Store-->>Registry: provider configs
    CLI->>Registry: create_data_source(name,...)
    Registry->>Config: get(name)
    Config-->>Registry: ProviderConfig
    Registry->>Creator: create_data_source(ProviderDataSourceCreationRequest)
    Creator->>DS: create_provider_data_source(request)
    DS-->>Creator: configured DataSourcePort
    Creator-->>Registry: configured DataSourcePort
    Registry-->>CLI: DataSourcePort
    opt caller requests provider-bound closure instead
        CLI->>Registry: build_data_source_creator(name)
        Registry->>Creator: require_data_source_creator / build_bound_creator
        Creator-->>CLI: closure bound to Registry.create_data_source(name)
    end

    Note over Registry,DS: Adapter creation and bound-closure creation are separate APIs; create_data_source delegates a configured request.
